-0254","start":254,"end":256,"surface":"文成","kind":"person","person_id":"zg6_76t_xid","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m017-0275","start":275,"end":277,"surface":"文成","kind":"person","person_id":"zg6_76t_xid","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m017-0296","start":296,"end":297,"surface":"大","kind":"person","person_id":"b4l_2ug_qy3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m017-0312","start":312,"end":314,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-012-wudi","book_id":"b-shiji-012","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-012-wudi"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:p018","text":"是時上方憂河決，而黃金不就，乃拜大為五利將軍。居月餘，得四金印，佩天士將軍、地土將軍、大通將軍、天道將軍印。制詔御史：「昔禹疏九江，決四瀆。閒者河溢皋陸，隄繇不息。朕臨天下二十有八年，天若遺朕士而大通焉。乾稱『蜚龍』，『鴻漸于般』，意庶幾與焉。其以二千戶封地士將軍大為樂通侯。」賜列侯甲第，僮千人。乘輿斥車馬帷帳器物以充其家。又以衛長公主妻之，齎金萬斤，更名其邑曰當利公主。天子親如五利之第。使者存問所給，連屬於道。自大主將相以下，皆置酒其家，獻遺之。於是天子又刻玉印曰「天道將軍」，使使衣羽衣，夜立白茅上，五利將軍亦衣羽衣，立白茅上受印，以示弗臣也。而佩「天道」者，且為天子道天神也。於是五利常夜祠其家，欲以下神。神未至而百鬼集矣，然頗能使之。其後治裝行，東入海，求其師云。大見數月，佩六印，貴振天下，而海上燕齊之閒，莫不搤捥而自言有禁方，能神僊矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m018-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"大","kind":"person","person_id":"b4l_2ug_qy3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m018-0018","start":18,"end":22,"surface":"五利將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"b4l_2ug_qy3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m018-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"6ip_dr3_fbl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m018-0132","start":132,"end":133,"surface":"大","kind":"person","person_id":"b4l_2ug_qy3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m018-0165","start":165,"end":169,"surface":"衛長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"tzq_88y_69k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-012-wudi:m018-0182","start":182,"end":186,"surface":"當利公